{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37382","headline":"和陶渊明贫士诗七首 五 · 唐彦谦","name":"和陶渊明贫士诗七首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古人重畎亩，有禄不待干。\n德成禄自至，释耒列王官。\n不仕亦不贫，本自足饔飱。\n後世耻躬耕，号呼脱饥寒。\n我生千𥜥後，念此愧在颜\n爲农倘可饱，何用出柴关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}